{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03J3", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$n \\geq 0$", "MATH_0003": "$n$", "MATH_0004": "$k$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Spec(k) \\to Y$", "MATH_0006": "$X_k = \\Spec(k) \\times_Y X$", "MATH_0007": "$n$", "MATH_0008": "$y \\in Y$", "MATH_0009": "$\\kappa(y) \\subset \\kappa(y)^{sep}$", "MATH_0010": "$X_{\\kappa(y)^{sep}}$", "MATH_0011": "$n$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-etale-universally-bounded}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9fbd553078a49253e96f1b05842c102595accedcd81da0d153a3e60e6c4ad345", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c0ed8b91861c3e0f3737ab7164cdc91027813c5372ce8d67026f205cf221495d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002>. The following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> the integer <MATH_0003> bounds the degrees of the fibres,\n<STRUCT_0003> for every field <MATH_0004> and morphism <MATH_0005> the\nbase change <MATH_0006> has at most <MATH_0007> points, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for every <MATH_0008> and every separable algebraic closure\n<MATH_0009> the scheme\n<MATH_0010> has at most <MATH_0011> points.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e38dd073e392fa3fb1ba40f78c0bd2b18bba2f5a132f7b2547771c2830a90ab5", "unit_id": "tag:03WU:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03J3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X_y$", "MATH_0002": "$\\kappa(y)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-characterize-universally-bounded}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-etale-over-field}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:dff1835bf48fd96da94e902a4e60aa3864493f8695147b3efd4ca2975befcfd5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:809d26954e7e354042e40e73cde239bf22c7330b06f1b80a682e8e9a603e84a4", "source_text": "This follows from\nLemma <REF_0001>\nand the fact that the fibres <MATH_0001> are disjoint unions of spectra of finite\nseparable field extensions of <MATH_0002>, see\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2279949e6f54683a792da68f750e78515e3d31f486f048dc0bf497df91f33b45", "unit_id": "tag:03WU:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03J3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:72ac09bf3b389b82a2ad290effd336ebf1a8f95af2d2ad688d37b7dfaaeccd26", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:29f0e5dd01ad124d93f7425399b2128208829945e757566b59a995a9a5659736", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHaving universally bounded fibres is an absolute notion and not a relative\nnotion. This is why the condition in the following lemma is that <MATH_0001> is\nquasi-compact, and not that <MATH_0002> is quasi-compact.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e046aabbdea10b3f67d54eaecca780b068ac40ae013cb3a1217444ef92eb214b", "unit_id": "tag:03J3:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03J3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-locally-quasi-finite-qc-source-universally-bounded}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7c2cf9ecfcbe5a6658559fc06fee4ad462a00a00868575569182f79ec4c1349f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:59f651e8dd690be374c5ecf6fdb43dda1599359580c44bf366701bcef9ff2a4f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nAssume that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is locally quasi-finite, and\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003> is quasi-compact.\n<STRUCT_0004>\nThen <MATH_0004> has universally bounded fibres.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2c007dc7ad6cbc169aeded4f9d3ce6b6c8ce52cd7b46e9b979d4aeae2446ad6c", "unit_id": "tag:03JA:statement"}
